{"abstract":"In this paper we introduce StoryTrek, a locative hypernarrative system developed to generate stories based on a reader’s location and specific movements in the real world. This creates, for readers, an interplay between navigation, narrative, and agency, as well as between the fictional and real world experience. In early tests we observed the emergence of a number of recurrent themes in participants’ experiences which are characteristic of the StoryTrek system, but which also help us to understand locative media storytelling affordances more generally. In this paper we present the system itself, along with initial thematic observations concerning agency, role play, reflection, and shared experience.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Khaled, Rilla","Barr, Pippin James","Greenspan, Brian","Biddle, Robert","Vist, Elise"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384411"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["Canada"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Carleton University"],"keyword":["Agency","Locative Hypernarrative","Locative Media Storytelling","Role play","StoryTrek"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"storytrek experiencing stories in the real world","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84860662093","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384411","identifier":[{"id":"84860662093","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-d5d4128b-3406-453f-a075-9149112d9393"],"keyword":["Agency","Locative Hypernarrative","Locative Media Storytelling","Role Play","StoryTrek"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0B0D22BB6D1F635C2DAF94781EADCF07"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ca","key":"carleton university","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Carleton University","used":1},{"affno":2,"key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Rilla","key":"khaledpau","last":"Khaled","name":"Khaled, Rilla","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Pippin James","key":"barrpau","last":"Barr","locid":"e4e94078-69c9-4ea3-92fe-6266f55511ea","name":"Barr, Pippin James","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Brian","key":"greenspanpau","last":"Greenspan","name":"Greenspan, Brian","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Robert","key":"biddlepau","last":"Biddle","name":"Biddle, Robert","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Elise","key":"vistpau","last":"Vist","name":"Vist, Elise","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9781450308168"],"status":"p","title":"Proceedings of MindTrek 2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84860662093"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-d5d4128b-3406-453f-a075-9149112d9393"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"StoryTrek: Experiencing Stories in the Real World","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384411","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
